    "title": "AR Draw Sketch & Paint",
    "description": "<b>AR Draw Sketch & Paint</b> - a application for artists, designers, creative individuals and raise your painting talent.\r\nApplication use the most powerful AR technology, bring out your creativity and create your own works of art.\r\nThe app provide a variety of category, like Chibi, Animals, Learn to Draw, Flowers, Face, for KID...\r\n\r\n<b>Main Features</b>:\r\n\ud83d\udd8c Draw by using your phone's camera.\r\n\ud83d\udd8c Variety of category to draw: <b>Chibi, Animals, Learn to Draw, Flowers, Face, for KID...</b>\r\n\ud83d\udd8c A built-in flashlight makes drawing easier.\r\n\ud83d\udd8c Upload your drawing to the gallery or social network\r\n\ud83d\udd8c Make the sketching and painting processes.\r\n\ud83d\udd8c Make a sketch and try sketching with it.\r\n\ud83d\udd8c Modify drawing strokes to make it easier to draw and practice painting.\r\n\ud83d\udd8c Take a photo to use in your sketchbook, or select one from the gallery.\r\n\r\n<b>AR Draw Sketch & Paint</b> is application that helps you to create paintings and sketches using AI reality technology. You can draw whatever you want on any surface or substance.\r\nDownload <b>AR Draw Sketch & Paint</b> right now and start making your own artwork!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>AR Draw Sketch &amp; Paint</b> - a application for artists, designers, creative individuals and raise your painting talent.<br>Application use the most powerful AR technology, bring out your creativity and create your own works of art.<br>The app provide a variety of category, like Chibi, Animals, Learn to Draw, Flowers, Face, for KID...<br><br><b>Main Features</b>:<br>\ud83d\udd8c Draw by using your phone&#39;s camera.<br>\ud83d\udd8c Variety of category to draw: <b>Chibi, Animals, Learn to Draw, Flowers, Face, for KID...</b><br>\ud83d\udd8c A built-in flashlight makes drawing easier.<br>\ud83d\udd8c Upload your drawing to the gallery or social network<br>\ud83d\udd8c Make the sketching and painting processes.<br>\ud83d\udd8c Make a sketch and try sketching with it.<br>\ud83d\udd8c Modify drawing strokes to make it easier to draw and practice painting.<br>\ud83d\udd8c Take a photo to use in your sketchbook, or select one from the gallery.<br><br><b>AR Draw Sketch &amp; Paint</b> is application that helps you to create paintings and sketches using AI reality technology. You can draw whatever you want on any surface or substance.<br>Download <b>AR Draw Sketch &amp; Paint</b> right now and start making your own artwork!",
